    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Sattelite</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sattelite is a clicker game about a satellite and signals. Click the signal of the Sattelite and crunch numbers till you win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual clicker stress testing satellite signals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Leaderboard</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item Drops</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Drops:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 common item card per 60min</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50% chance of uncommon item card</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20% chance of of rare item card</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Game Modes:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leader Mode [10-30 min]</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
